  "manufacturer": "BIGTREETECH",
  "description": "BIGTREETECH's EZ-Driver form-factor variant of the TMC2130. EZ drivers use a dual-connector pluggable layout that is less prone to incorrect insertion than legacy StepStick sockets and allows hot-swap on compatible EZ-socket mainboards. Based on Trinamic's TMC2130 chip with SPI and Step/Dir interface.",
